<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fortune Brands started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fortune Brands started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Fortune Brands Inc as outperform.</p>
<p>-- the former American Brands Inc spun off its international tobacco operations and changed its name to Fortune Brands. Fortune Brands started trade on the New York Stock Exchange on June 2.</p>
<p>-- Fortune Brands was unchanged at 31-1/4.</p>
</text>
